      "by": "greptile-apps",
      "ask": "**Hydration skips custom event code** Under `transport=\"socketio\"`, the boot event now reaches `handle_event` directly instead of `self.on_event`. Apps that replace `EventNamespace` and override `on_event` still run their custom code for later events, but skip it during initial hydration and reconnect hydration. Any checks or other work in that override are skipped for those requests. Keep boot events going through the overridden `on_event`, with the shared error policy around that call. Note: If this suggestion doesn't match your team's coding style, reply to this and let me know. I'll remember it for next time!",
